{# ============================ LOCATION ROUTER ============================ #}
{#
  Section 3 per the brief, all seven from locations.json.

  The concept hardcoded a street address and an opening-hours range on every
  row. Both are removed. CLIENT_FACTS.md flags every hours value as unverified
  and says do not publish hours the door does not honor, and four of the seven
  street addresses are unconfirmed (Convoy's suite is the known citation
  defect). Rows show the neighborhood and the year, which are confirmed, and
  the street line renders only where locations.json has a confirmed value.
#}
<section class="locations" id="locations" aria-labelledby="locations-title">
  <div class="locations__inner">
    <header class="locations__head">
      <h2 class="locations__title" id="locations-title">Where to <em>find us.</em></h2>
    </header>

    {%- for loc in locations.items %}
    <article class="locations__row">
      <span class="locations__row-no">&#8470;&nbsp;{{ "0" if loop.index < 10 }}{{ loop.index }}</span>
      <h3 class="locations__row-name">
        <a href="{{ loc.url }}">{{ loc.name }} <em>{{ loc.descriptor }}</em></a>
      </h3>
      <address class="locations__row-addr">
        {%- if loc.address.street %}{{ loc.address.street }}, {% endif -%}
        {%- if loc.neighborhood and loc.neighborhood != loc.address.locality %}{{ loc.neighborhood }}, {% endif -%}
        {{ loc.address.locality }}, {{ loc.address.region }}
        {%- if loc.address.postalCode %} {{ loc.address.postalCode }}{% endif -%}
      </address>
      {%- if loc.opened %}
      <span class="locations__row-since">Since {{ loc.opened }}</span>
      {%- endif %}
    </article>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

{# ============================ MENU TEASER ============================ #}
{#
  Section 4 per the brief, featured bowls only, links to /menu/.
  Filtered to feature: true plus a photo, so nothing renders an empty frame.
  Carnitas Ramen is absent from menu.json on purpose (Open Decision #4).

  REWRITTEN note line. The concept read "Tonkotsu base simmered twelve hours in
  the Crown Point commissary. Noodles cut daily in the Noodle Room." Neither
  the simmer time nor the noodle cadence is confirmed. What is confirmed is
  that broth is made every morning in Crown Point and driven out before
  service, and that noodles are made in our own Noodle Room.
#}
<section class="menu" id="menu" aria-labelledby="menu-title">
  <div class="menu__inner">
    <header class="menu__head">
      <h2 class="menu__title" id="menu-title">The <em>bowls.</em></h2>
      <p class="menu__note">
        Broth simmered every morning in the Crown Point commissary and driven out before service. Noodles from our own Noodle Room.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="menu__grid">
      {%- for dish in menu.items %}
        {%- if dish.feature and dish.image %}
      <article class="dish reveal reveal--d{{ loop.index % 3 + 1 }}">
        <figure class="dish__figure">
          <img class="dish__img" src="{{ dish.image }}" alt="{{ dish.alt }}" loading="lazy" width="600" height="600">
        </figure>
        <div class="dish__meta">
          <h3 class="dish__name">
            {%- if dish.emphasis -%}
              {{ dish.shortName | replace(dish.emphasis, "") }}<em>{{ dish.emphasis }}</em>
            {%- else -%}
              {{ dish.shortName }}
            {%- endif -%}
          </h3>
          <span class="dish__price">${{ dish.price }}</span>
        </div>
        {%- if dish.description %}
        <p class="dish__desc">{{ dish.description }}</p>
        {%- endif %}
      </article>
        {%- endif %}
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>

    <p class="menu__more">
      <a class="menu__more-link" href="/menu/">See the whole menu</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

{# ============================ THE FILM ============================ #}
{#
  The concept titled this "Twenty-five years on Convoy. Told in his own words."
  and labelled it "A film by Tajima · 01:20". Softened: nobody here has
  verified the runtime, and "in his own words" asserts what the film contains.
  The video itself is a real client asset on the Tajima CDN.
#}
<section class="curtain-stage" aria-labelledby="film-title">
  <div class="curtain-stage__rail">
    <span class="curtain-stage__eyebrow">A film by Tajima</span>
    <h2 class="curtain-stage__title" id="film-title">
      Twenty-five years <em>on Convoy.</em>
    </h2>
  </div>

  <div class="curtain-stage__house">
    <div class="curtain curtain--left" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="curtain__panel"></div>
      <div class="curtain__rope"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="curtain curtain--right" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="curtain__panel"></div>
      <div class="curtain__rope"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="curtain-stage__screen" data-curtain-stage>
      <video
        class="curtain-stage__video"
        src="https://cdn.circulationstudio.com/tajima-temp/videos/tajima-brand-video-web-1080p.mp4"
        loop
        playsinline
        preload="metadata"
        aria-label="A film about Tajima Ramen"></video>

      <button type="button" class="curtain-stage__play" data-curtain-play>
        <svg class="curtain-stage__play-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
          <polygon points="6 4 20 12 6 20 6 4"></polygon>
        </svg>
        <span class="curtain-stage__play-label">Watch the film</span>
      </button>

      <button type="button" class="curtain-stage__pause" data-curtain-pause aria-label="Stop the film" hidden>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line>
          <line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="curtain-stage__floor" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  </div>
</section>

